          "title": "You'll want to know: સરળ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "સરળ — saraḷ — \"straightforward (of a person)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મારી બહેનપણી સરળ સ્વભાવની છે. mārī bahenpaṇī saraḷ svabhāvnī che. My friend has a straightforward nature."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "સરળ (saraḷ) is a tatsama, Sanskrit sarala, \"straight, not crooked\", as Monier-Williams records it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
