              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઓછાબોલું — ochābolũ — \"quiet; of few words\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અરુણ ઓછાબોલો છે, પણ ઘણું સમજે છે. Aruṇ ochābolo che, paṇ ghaṇũ samje che. Arun is a man of few words, but he understands a lot."
            }
          ]
        },
